          "release_status": "FORMALISM",
          "notes": "The original owner defines W(k,mu,prod_c)=mu^(1-k)*prod_c and proves the degree 0 and 1 identities with the 16 cell sectors. ArchiveGradedMetricMeasureBinding now proves for every level, site and Fock sector that this formula, with the explicitly constructed positive counting masses and degree-scaled conductances, equals the actual graded pullback Gram diagonal. A zero-mass counterexample retains the generic nonzero hypothesis. This prescribed algebraic realization does not select a unique or canonical Hodge metric, physical normalization, source or refinement admission."
